# BuildKit uses THIS file in place of the root .dockerignore when building with
# `-f generator.Dockerfile` (per-Dockerfile ignore, docker/buildx). The root
# .dockerignore is tuned for the Rust mock-server build and excludes `src/` and
# `*.md` — which the Python generator image REQUIRES (the tenantless package lives
# under src/, and hatchling needs LICENSE). This list keeps the small set of build
# inputs the generator needs and drops everything heavy/irrelevant.
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.venv/
target/
mock-server/target/
frontend/
build/
.planning/
.remember/
.codegraph/
.playwright-mcp/
.pytest_cache/
control-data/
scratchpad/
docs/
tests/
# Keep the top-level profiles/ OUT of the build context (it holds data-boundary
# sensitive denylists) EXCEPT the JSON schema, which the generate path validates
# against at /app/profiles/schema.json.
profiles/*
!profiles/schema.json
media/
*.duckdb
*.png
.env
